2 CONT From Odland Family History Book (~1995) "Tonnes Torstenson Aanestad, son of Torsten Pederson Aanestad and Guri Storkardsdtr Aanestad married Astrid Olsdtr Odland, daughter of Ola Gregoriuson Odland and Johanna Klausdtr Friestad. T
2 CONC onnes name was changed to Odland.  Astrid bought the Odland farm from her mother. This farm had been in the Odland family since 1822. There were 12 children born to Tonnes and Astrid Odland at their home in Odland Jaren, nine grew
2 CONC  to adulthood and 7 of these immigrated to America.  In 1934 this Oldand farm became the Madland farm."
