1 NAME Ole Andreas Pedersen /Gilje/
2 GIVN Ole Andreas Pedersen
2 SURN Gilje
2 _MARNM Lea
2 NICK Ole Andreas Lea
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 12 JUN 1796
2 ADDR
3 CITY Gilje, Høyland
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 20 FEB 1849
2 ADDR
