2 CONT * Gards og ættesoga for Hå, bind III, Matingsdal, side 266, nr. 6, https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2017012629001?page=269
2 CONT * Gards og ættesoga for Hå, bind III, Matingsdal, side 266, nr. 8, https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2017012629001?page=269
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Karen Ellingsdotter (daughter of Elling Fuglestad) was born 1678 in Fuglestad, Norway, and died date unknown. She married (1) Tore Larsson. She married (2) Tore Nilsson on 06 Jun 1702.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Notes for Karen Ellingsdotter: ! She was the widow of Tore Larsson. See Fuglestad 7d. Ogna p.205.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Karen Ellingsdotter and Tore Nilsson: Marriage: 06 Jun 1702
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Karen Ellingsdotter and Tore Nilsson are:
2 CONT *Malena Toresdotter, b. 16 Nov 1703, d. date unknown.
2 CONT *Tore Toreson, b. 1705, d. date unknown.
2 CONT *+Elling Toreson, b. 02 Feb 1705/06, Matingsdal, Norway, d. date unknown.
2 CONT *Nils Toreson, b. 17 May 1708, d. date unknown.
2 CONT *Tore Matingsdal Toreson, b. 06 Jun 1713, d. 1787.
2 CONT *Gullik Toreson, b. 1717, d. date unknown.
2 CONT *Johannes Toreson, b. 1719, d. 1742.
2 CONT *Ola Toreson, b. 06 Dec 1722, d. date unknown.
