2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/86f2120d1cf6c399be7d31a8aba2e7fa?page=138 "Bjerkreimboka: folket og eigedomane gjennom dei siste fem hundre åra", Bind 1 (Bjerkreim, 7A. Lars Larsson, p. 135)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Is there any ''evidence'' that Lars (Laurits) Fuglestad was the son of a Rasmus Lauritsen Fuglestad and Magle Larsdatter Fuglestad, as suggested here? According to [https://www.nb.no/items/9f3df5c0d3cee86a23f30408ef31446c?page=
2 CONC 206 "Gards og Ættesoga for Ogna"] he had a ''son'', that was named Rasmus Lauritsen Fuglestad and who was married to a Magle Larsdatter Fuglestad.'''
2 CONT ----
