2 CONT Torsten took over the family farm for a few years. In 1910 he sold the farm to Andrine his eldest daughter and his brother Jonas who had returned from the USA. Andrine's son Torsten Auestad, took over the farm in 1928 and farmed u
2 CONC ntil his death in 1933. His widow Pauline married Lars Madland in 1934. Now their sons own the farm which had been in the Odland family since 1822. So it is now known as the Madland farm.
2 CONT --------------------
