2 CONT Submitted by Wm. Keith Johnson from "Find-A-Grave" web site: 
2 CONT  Birth: 	1898  Alberta, Canada Death: 	Jul. 3, 1971  Alberta, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT SKRETTING — Funeral service for Jorgine Skretting of Vauxhall, formerly of Bow City, who died in Vauxhall July 3 at the age of 72, was held in the Evangelical Free Church,  Enchant July 16 with the Rev. W, Burrel officiating, pall
2 CONC bearers were Thorsten Skretting. Gustav Skretting, Arnold Skretting, James Skretting, Edwin Skretting and Gudmund Skretting. Interment was the Enchant Cemetery, Humphries Funeral Home Ltd. Taber, was in charge of the arrangements.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT and from Oldand Family History book:  " Born in 1898, the youngest child in a family of 6, born to maria and Torsten,     a boy and girl died as infants. Her home for her 1st 11 years was the old Odland home. Then she lived in the
2 CONC  present Odland home until her marriage in 1919.  She was 10 years old when her mother died. 14, when her sister Andrine died leaving a six year old orphan son, who Jorgine grew up with while living with her dad and 2 uncles.     
2 CONC                After marriage she and her husband farmed a Varhaug farm from until 1927 when her husband returned to Alberta to his homestead near Bow City, Alberta.  In 1928 Jorgine and her oldest 4 children followed.  It was a 1
2 CONC 4 day journey by boat /and train.      In 1937 the family moved to Circle Hill, near Vauxhall to thier irrigation farm, where she lived until her death in 1971, after having raised 10 children. One son died at age 17.     She spen
2 CONC t her last 5 years as a widow living with her 2 oldest sons on this farm.   Jorgine was confirmed and married in the Odland Church."      
