1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Gards- og ættesoga for Hå, bind II, Odland, side 188, nr. 59.d, https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2017012629002?page=191
2 CONT
2 CONT John was my mothers uncle but after his first wife Gudrun died he married Minnie Odland whose husband and John's brother Sam Odland had also passed away.   So I knew him as my grandfather.  Note Sam & Minnie adopted the 4 children
2 CONC  after the children's mother Hanna Charlotte died soon after Charlotte' birth. After Hanna's death the children first went back t o Minnesota to live with their maternal Grandparents the Nyquists prior to being adopted by their Un
2 CONC cle Sam and Minnie.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Keith Johnson
2 CONT
2 CONT John Semson Odland  Birth: July 2, 1890     Odland, Varhaug, Hå, Rogaland, Norway  Death: July 15, 1967 (77)    Calgary, Division No. 6, Alberta, Canada 
2 CONT
