1 NOTE !SO:  translate NLR #93 [ ].
2 CONT     NLR #93 lists name as Mathias Helgeson, and under #74d. as Mathias Aanestad.
2 CONT     (A-020-Q) lists name as Mattias, twin, b. 1842
2 CONT     (A-020-N) lists name as Mathias, b. date 4-17-1842.
2 CONT      A-020-O  lists Mathias, b. date 4-17-1842.
2 CONT BURIAL: Varhaug Cemetery.  Hallvard Aanestad sent a photograph of Sam and me at
2 CONT         the grave of Mathias during our visit to Norway in 1994.  Mathias was
2 CONT         Hallvard's grandfather.
1 NOTE !SO:  translate NLR #93 [ ].
2 CONT     NLR #93 lists name as Mathias Helgeson, and under #74d. as Mathias Aanestad.
2 CONT     (A-020-Q) lists name as Mattias, twin, b. 1842
2 CONT     (A-020-N) lists name as Mathias, b. date 4-17-1842.
2 CONT      A-020-O  lists Mathias, b. date 4-17-1842.
2 CONT BURIAL: Varhaug Cemetery.  Hallvard Aanestad sent a photograph of Sam and me at
2 CONT         the grave of Mathias during our visit to Norway in 1994.  Mathias was
2 CONT         Hallvard's grandfather.
1 NOTE !SO: NLR. Twin brother of Mathias.  He was a laborer in Sandsvaer.
2 CONT      A-020-U also shows Martin at Sandsver.
2 CONT      A-020-N lists name as Martin, b. date as 4-17-1842.
2 CONT      a-020-O lists Martin, b. date 4-17-1842.
2 CONT      A-075   lists children with last name "Waal".  Reason not given.
2 CONT (A-020-U) has a note that Martin got the picture (of Ole F) which had first
2 CONT           been given by his grandmother, Martha, to her son Ole.  Martin is
2 CONT           said to have been named for his grandmother, Martha.
2 CONT PROBLEM: A-020-U lists a Martin (is this the one?) and what appears to be names
2 CONT         of his children: Malene Vaal - Hoansal, Helge (died), Hanna (died),
2 CONT         and Gina (died).
2 CONT A-020-R From Alert Palmer Aanestad, my thoughts 3-17-1975.  "The way I piece it
2 CONT         together from Salina's report of the trip to Norway in 1928, where she
2 CONT         tells of the visit to Waals in Sandevar, south of Kingsberg.  But the
2 CONT         name of those living on the place, she gives as Hvambaal which leaves
2 CONT         me a little unclear.  It looks like this -
2 CONT           Martin Aanestad, Pa's brother, married a wife in Sandevar and,
2 CONT         perhaps she was a Waal.  Then the farm was Waal?  Their daughter,
2 CONT         Malina, our cousin, married Karl Hvambaal.  She had died in 1915.  Karl
2 CONT         Hvambaal was 72 in 1928 and Selina describes him as a young looking old
2 CONT         man.  Three of Karl and Malina's children lived on the farm.   Halvor
2 CONT         operated the farm.  Peder worked in a bank near by.  Sophie kept house.
2 CONT         Gina was married and lived nearby.  Another sister worked in Honefuns
2 CONT         (spelling).  The old grandmother living with them was 80 in 1928.  That
2 CONT         would be Martin's wife, the mother of Malena.  Selina does not mention
2 CONT         the grandmother's name".
1 NOTE !SO: NLR. Twin brother of Mathias.  He was a laborer in Sandsvaer.
