1 NAME Abraham Abrahamson /Abrahamson Helland/
2 GIVN Abraham Abrahamson
2 SURN Abrahamson Helland
2 _MARNM Helland
2 NICK Helleland
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 DATE 18 SEP 1746
