1 NAME Jon Monsen /Undheim/
2 GIVN Jon Monsen
2 SURN Undheim
2 _MARNM Vashus
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1625
2 PLAC Store Undheim, Time, Rogaland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1676
2 PLAC Vashus, Klepp, Rogaland
