2 CONT Ingeborg Larsdtr Skjelset Haaland BIRTH	30 Jan 1853 Time kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway DEATH	7 Jun 1930 (aged 77) Astoria, Clatsop County, Oregon, USA BURIAL	 Ocean View Cemetery Warrenton, Clatsop County, Oregon, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg Larsdtr Skjelset Born 30 January 1853, Skjelset Farm Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT #15 https://media.digitalarkivet.no/en/view/1632/121 Lye Parish, Time, Rogaland, Norway Daughter to Lars Olsen Skjelset 1812-1887 & Rakel Isaksdtr Egeland 1820-1847. Baptized 27 February 1853 in Lye Parish, Time, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONC  Conformation was held 6 October 1867 in Lye Parish. #7. https://media.digitalarkivet.no/en/view/1634/204 Ingeborg Married Jesper Rasmussen Håland, 29 August 1876, #50. https://media.digitalarkivet.no/en/view/6257/403 A widower & 
2 CONC father to Marte Jespersdtr. Ingeborg, Jesper, stepdaughter Marte, Amelia & Rasmus, Emigrated to America 30 June 1883 arriving in New York and settling in Minnesota.
2 CONT #22. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070102340135 Ingeborg & Jesper had 9 children, 3 born in Norway and 6 born in Minnesota. Melia died at birth in Norway, Amelia & Rasmus born in Norway & Lars, Rachel, Jasper, Julia & Norman a
2 CONC ll born in Hanley Falls, Minnesota. By 1920 Ingeborg & Jesper had migrated to North Dakota and continued onto Inverness Hills Montana, by 1930 onto Astoria Clapsop County Oregon where they lived out their life at 269 Commercial St
2 CONC reet, Astoria Oregon.
